        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "As a white alone traveller, I was made to feel really comfortable here. Everyone was really nice and a table fully of people quickly called me over and we had a great night! Good karaoke with English songs too. A bit on the expensive side, but it has a good atmosphere. The staff and manager are great and welcoming. I’d recommend a night out here and will pop back again before I go.\nThanks",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
